  "duration_s": 465.448276,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上集说到一九四八年，何泽会和丈夫钱三强放弃了法国的一切，带着半岁的女儿回到了一穷二白的中国。很多人以为诺奖级的科学家回国，肯定是要风得风，要雨得雨。没有，当时中国的原子能事业是一张白纸，要设备、没设备，要资料、没资料。西方国家对中国严防死守，苏联后来又撤走了全部专家。何则会接到的第一项重要任务是研制核乳胶核乳胶是什么？是研究核物理的核心工具，没有他原子弹的很多，关键实验根本做不了。可当时中国连一台像样的仪器都没有，何则，会带着两个年轻人去旧货摊买各种零件，自己所组装仪器，自己改良设备，自己做实验。就这么徒法上马。一九五六年，他们成功研制出了达到国际先进水平的核乳胶。紧接着，原子弹的点火装置遇到了技术瓶颈，何泽会默默展开实验，成功研制出了原子弹的点火中子源，确保了一九六四年第一颗原子弹顺利引爆。要不是他出手，中国原子弹的进程可能要晚上好几年，原子弹搞成了清淡，又遇到了麻烦。研制清淡的过程中，团队发现关键数据有问题，需要全部重测。平常做这样的物理实验，大概需要三年时间。但清淡盐制等不起，国际形势不等人。何则慧带着团队夜以继日的泡在实验室里，最后只用了几个月就推翻了原来的数据，让氢弹如期完成。毫不夸张的说，如果没有他，中国的氢弹可能要晚好几年才能搞出来，可你知道吗？就是这样一个为两弹事业立下汗马功劳的人，一九六九年却被下放到外地，扫了好几年厕所，有人替他鸣不平，何则。会笑了笑，说了一句话，没有谁对不起我们国家需要我，我就去做。一九七三年，中科院高能物理研究所成立五十九岁的何则慧高龄挂帅。这个年纪，别人早就退休享福了，他却带着氧气瓶跑到海拔四千多米的青藏高原，在那里建立。何如交观测站？高原反应让他喘不上气，他吸一口氧接着干。就这样，中国成了当时世界上少数几个能生产核乳胶的国家之一。他还为国家培养出了第一个气球工程博士发展的空间x射线探测技术。二零一七年，中国第一颗x射线天门卫星慧眼发射升空，这个名字就是为了纪念何泽惠。可你再看看他的生活，他把祖上留下的苏州园林往施园，那可是世界文化遗产价值上亿，无偿捐给了国家自己的蜗居。在一间只有二十平米的破旧小屋里，一住就是几十年，中科院要给他配专车。他直接拒绝了，直到二零零零年，他还坚持坐公交车上班。九十二岁那年，他还挤着绿皮火车。到外地出差。一九九二年，丈夫钱三强去世了，他又一个人为国家奉献了整整十九年。二零一一年六月二十日，何泽会在北京逝世，享年九十七岁。他走的时候，邻居甚至不知道这个天天坐公交车住破房子。在菜摊前被人翻白眼的老太太是中国顶尖的核物理科学家，最让人心疼的是什么？一九九九年，国家表彰两弹一星功勋科学家这二十三个名字里竟然没有何泽会。他为原子弹做了点火，中子源为清淡，抢回了几年时间，为中国核物理事业从零起步打下了根基。可功劳簿上没有他的名字，他从来没争过，从来没抱怨过。有人采访他，问他是怎么发现游河寺分裂的？他当当一句，我看见了，就发现了，每个人都可以发现好些东西，除非你一天到晚不动脑筋。记者又提到他为原子弹、氢弹做出的贡献，他直接说，这不算什么，都是些超烂的本子。听说现在的年轻人爱听他的故事，老太太头一歪，还有点不乐意，他们来向我学习。你倒霉了，我们我做事都不符合时代，就是这么一个耿直朴素、不图名不图利的老太太，把这一辈子都奉献给了这个国家。她出身名门，却选了最难走的那条路。她功高盖世却甘愿隐姓埋名，他把价值连城的祖宅捐给国家，自己住二十平米的破房子。何泽会这三个字不该被忘记。其实像何泽慧这样的人，还有很多很多，他们有的在戈壁滩上隐姓埋名几十年，有的在实验室里熬到油尽灯枯，有的把毕生积蓄捐给国家，自己却连一件新衣服都舍不得买。他们是真正的国之脊梁，却很少出现在聚光灯下。如果你想知道更多他们的故事，推荐，你看看国之脊梁。这本书，书里记录了几十位为新中国立下汗马功劳的科学家和建设者。钱学森邓稼先、袁隆平、屠呦呦，还有像何泽会这样，功劳簿上没有名字，却同样不该被遗忘的人。每一个名字背后都是一段拿命拼出来的传奇。读完你会明白，今天的安稳日子不是天上掉下来的，是有人用一辈子替我们扛下来的。点。左下方链接把这本书带回家，自己读也给孩子读，让我们的下一代知道谁才是真正该追的。星点赞是给何泽会迟来的掌声收发，是怕以后再也找不到这样的故事。收发是让更多人知道谁才是真正的国家脊梁。关注我，咱们一起把该记住的人一个一个讲完。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 2610,
      "text": "上集说到一九四八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2890,
      "end_ms": 7050,
      "text": "何泽会和丈夫钱三强放弃了法国的一切，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00003",
      "start_ms": 7470,
      "end_ms": 10930,
      "text": "带着半岁的女儿回到了一穷二白的中国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00004",
      "start_ms": 11590,
      "end_ms": 15350,
      "text": "很多人以为诺奖级的科学家回国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00005",
      "start_ms": 15810,
      "end_ms": 17450,
      "text": "肯定是要风得风，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00006",
      "start_ms": 17530,
      "end_ms": 18350,
      "text": "要雨得雨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00007",
      "start_ms": 19270,
      "end_ms": 19730,
      "text": "没有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00008",
      "start_ms": 20530,
      "end_ms": 24690,
      "text": "当时中国的原子能事业是一张白纸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00009",
      "start_ms": 25710,
      "end_ms": 27330,
      "text": "要设备、没设备，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00010",
      "start_ms": 28190,
      "end_ms": 29725,
      "text": "要资料、没资料。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00011",
      "start_ms": 30200,
      "end_ms": 32980,
      "text": "西方国家对中国严防死守，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00012",
      "start_ms": 33700,
      "end_ms": 36460,
      "text": "苏联后来又撤走了全部专家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00013",
      "start_ms": 37380,
      "end_ms": 43940,
      "text": "何则会接到的第一项重要任务是研制核乳胶核乳胶是什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00014",
      "start_ms": 44120,
      "end_ms": 46640,
      "text": "是研究核物理的核心工具，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00015",
      "start_ms": 47180,
      "end_ms": 49220,
      "text": "没有他原子弹的很多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00016",
      "start_ms": 49220,
      "end_ms": 51060,
      "text": "关键实验根本做不了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00017",
      "start_ms": 51600,
      "end_ms": 54580,
      "text": "可当时中国连一台像样的仪器都没有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00018",
      "start_ms": 55040,
      "end_ms": 55420,
      "text": "何则，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00019",
      "start_ms": 55420,
      "end_ms": 58980,
      "text": "会带着两个年轻人去旧货摊买各种零件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00020",
      "start_ms": 58980,
      "end_ms": 61010,
      "text": "自己所组装仪器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00021",
      "start_ms": 61350,
      "end_ms": 62590,
      "text": "自己改良设备，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00022",
      "start_ms": 62850,
      "end_ms": 63915,
      "text": "自己做实验。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00023",
      "start_ms": 64360,
      "end_ms": 65755,
      "text": "就这么徒法上马。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00024",
      "start_ms": 66250,
      "end_ms": 67310,
      "text": "一九五六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00025",
      "start_ms": 67750,
      "end_ms": 72105,
      "text": "他们成功研制出了达到国际先进水平的核乳胶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00026",
      "start_ms": 72650,
      "end_ms": 73315,
      "text": "紧接着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00027",
      "start_ms": 73660,
      "end_ms": 77130,
      "text": "原子弹的点火装置遇到了技术瓶颈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00028",
      "start_ms": 77350,
      "end_ms": 79275,
      "text": "何泽会默默展开实验，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00029",
      "start_ms": 79720,
      "end_ms": 83495,
      "text": "成功研制出了原子弹的点火中子源，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00030",
      "start_ms": 84110,
      "end_ms": 88055,
      "text": "确保了一九六四年第一颗原子弹顺利引爆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00031",
      "start_ms": 88670,
      "end_ms": 89715,
      "text": "要不是他出手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00032",
      "start_ms": 90220,
      "end_ms": 93995,
      "text": "中国原子弹的进程可能要晚上好几年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00033",
      "start_ms": 94470,
      "end_ms": 96545,
      "text": "原子弹搞成了清淡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00034",
      "start_ms": 96900,
      "end_ms": 98035,
      "text": "又遇到了麻烦。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00035",
      "start_ms": 98510,
      "end_ms": 100290,
      "text": "研制清淡的过程中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00036",
      "start_ms": 100470,
      "end_ms": 103005,
      "text": "团队发现关键数据有问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00037",
      "start_ms": 103600,
      "end_ms": 105205,
      "text": "需要全部重测。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00038",
      "start_ms": 106080,
      "end_ms": 107885,
      "text": "平常做这样的物理实验，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00039",
      "start_ms": 108310,
      "end_ms": 110395,
      "text": "大概需要三年时间。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00040",
      "start_ms": 110990,
      "end_ms": 112745,
      "text": "但清淡盐制等不起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00041",
      "start_ms": 113150,
      "end_ms": 114875,
      "text": "国际形势不等人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00042",
      "start_ms": 115150,
      "end_ms": 119485,
      "text": "何则慧带着团队夜以继日的泡在实验室里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00043",
      "start_ms": 119890,
      "end_ms": 123590,
      "text": "最后只用了几个月就推翻了原来的数据，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00044",
      "start_ms": 123970,
      "end_ms": 126050,
      "text": "让氢弹如期完成。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00045",
      "start_ms": 126770,
      "end_ms": 128070,
      "text": "毫不夸张的说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00046",
      "start_ms": 128610,
      "end_ms": 129630,
      "text": "如果没有他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00047",
      "start_ms": 130470,
      "end_ms": 134710,
      "text": "中国的氢弹可能要晚好几年才能搞出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00048",
      "start_ms": 135670,
      "end_ms": 136690,
      "text": "可你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00049",
      "start_ms": 137590,
      "end_ms": 142610,
      "text": "就是这样一个为两弹事业立下汗马功劳的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00050",
      "start_ms": 144210,
      "end_ms": 147350,
      "text": "一九六九年却被下放到外地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00051",
      "start_ms": 147770,
      "end_ms": 149445,
      "text": "扫了好几年厕所，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00052",
      "start_ms": 149900,
      "end_ms": 151320,
      "text": "有人替他鸣不平，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00053",
      "start_ms": 152360,
      "end_ms": 152820,
      "text": "何则。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00054",
      "start_ms": 152820,
      "end_ms": 153600,
      "text": "会笑了笑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00055",
      "start_ms": 153840,
      "end_ms": 154620,
      "text": "说了一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00056",
      "start_ms": 154660,
      "end_ms": 157660,
      "text": "没有谁对不起我们国家需要我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00057",
      "start_ms": 157820,
      "end_ms": 158620,
      "text": "我就去做。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00058",
      "start_ms": 159520,
      "end_ms": 160600,
      "text": "一九七三年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00059",
      "start_ms": 160840,
      "end_ms": 167180,
      "text": "中科院高能物理研究所成立五十九岁的何则慧高龄挂帅。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00060",
      "start_ms": 168500,
      "end_ms": 169400,
      "text": "这个年纪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00061",
      "start_ms": 169940,
      "end_ms": 172040,
      "text": "别人早就退休享福了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00062",
      "start_ms": 172500,
      "end_ms": 177420,
      "text": "他却带着氧气瓶跑到海拔四千多米的青藏高原，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00063",
      "start_ms": 178200,
      "end_ms": 179160,
      "text": "在那里建立。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00064",
      "start_ms": 179180,
      "end_ms": 180515,
      "text": "何如交观测站？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00065",
      "start_ms": 181480,
      "end_ms": 183295,
      "text": "高原反应让他喘不上气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00066",
      "start_ms": 183840,
      "end_ms": 185865,
      "text": "他吸一口氧接着干。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00067",
      "start_ms": 186900,
      "end_ms": 187465,
      "text": "就这样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00068",
      "start_ms": 188440,
      "end_ms": 194500,
      "text": "中国成了当时世界上少数几个能生产核乳胶的国家之一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00069",
      "start_ms": 194580,
      "end_ms": 201975,
      "text": "他还为国家培养出了第一个气球工程博士发展的空间x射线探测技术。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00070",
      "start_ms": 202450,
      "end_ms": 203425,
      "text": "二零一七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00071",
      "start_ms": 203780,
      "end_ms": 208305,
      "text": "中国第一颗x射线天门卫星慧眼发射升空，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00072",
      "start_ms": 208890,
      "end_ms": 213745,
      "text": "这个名字就是为了纪念何泽惠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00073",
      "start_ms": 214570,
      "end_ms": 216215,
      "text": "可你再看看他的生活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00074",
      "start_ms": 217070,
      "end_ms": 220015,
      "text": "他把祖上留下的苏州园林往施园，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00075",
      "start_ms": 220500,
      "end_ms": 223835,
      "text": "那可是世界文化遗产价值上亿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00076",
      "start_ms": 224350,
      "end_ms": 227780,
      "text": "无偿捐给了国家自己的蜗居。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00077",
      "start_ms": 227780,
      "end_ms": 231620,
      "text": "在一间只有二十平米的破旧小屋里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00078",
      "start_ms": 231620,
      "end_ms": 233135,
      "text": "一住就是几十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00079",
      "start_ms": 234050,
      "end_ms": 235685,
      "text": "中科院要给他配专车。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00080",
      "start_ms": 236110,
      "end_ms": 237225,
      "text": "他直接拒绝了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00081",
      "start_ms": 237800,
      "end_ms": 239485,
      "text": "直到二零零零年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00082",
      "start_ms": 239800,
      "end_ms": 241875,
      "text": "他还坚持坐公交车上班。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00083",
      "start_ms": 242520,
      "end_ms": 243885,
      "text": "九十二岁那年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00084",
      "start_ms": 244270,
      "end_ms": 245830,
      "text": "他还挤着绿皮火车。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00085",
      "start_ms": 245830,
      "end_ms": 246915,
      "text": "到外地出差。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00086",
      "start_ms": 247510,
      "end_ms": 248490,
      "text": "一九九二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00087",
      "start_ms": 248630,
      "end_ms": 250455,
      "text": "丈夫钱三强去世了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00088",
      "start_ms": 251290,
      "end_ms": 255215,
      "text": "他又一个人为国家奉献了整整十九年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00089",
      "start_ms": 256170,
      "end_ms": 258055,
      "text": "二零一一年六月二十日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00090",
      "start_ms": 258760,
      "end_ms": 260335,
      "text": "何泽会在北京逝世，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00091",
      "start_ms": 260860,
      "end_ms": 262225,
      "text": "享年九十七岁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00092",
      "start_ms": 262760,
      "end_ms": 263720,
      "text": "他走的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00093",
      "start_ms": 263940,
      "end_ms": 268705,
      "text": "邻居甚至不知道这个天天坐公交车住破房子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00094",
      "start_ms": 269040,
      "end_ms": 275225,
      "text": "在菜摊前被人翻白眼的老太太是中国顶尖的核物理科学家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00095",
      "start_ms": 276010,
      "end_ms": 277790,
      "text": "最让人心疼的是什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00096",
      "start_ms": 277910,
      "end_ms": 278930,
      "text": "一九九九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00097",
      "start_ms": 279210,
      "end_ms": 285585,
      "text": "国家表彰两弹一星功勋科学家这二十三个名字里竟然没有何泽会。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00098",
      "start_ms": 286410,
      "end_ms": 288330,
      "text": "他为原子弹做了点火，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00099",
      "start_ms": 288350,
      "end_ms": 290185,
      "text": "中子源为清淡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00100",
      "start_ms": 290470,
      "end_ms": 291765,
      "text": "抢回了几年时间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00101",
      "start_ms": 292270,
      "end_ms": 296425,
      "text": "为中国核物理事业从零起步打下了根基。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00102",
      "start_ms": 297140,
      "end_ms": 299585,
      "text": "可功劳簿上没有他的名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00103",
      "start_ms": 299910,
      "end_ms": 301190,
      "text": "他从来没争过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00104",
      "start_ms": 301470,
      "end_ms": 302790,
      "text": "从来没抱怨过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00105",
      "start_ms": 302930,
      "end_ms": 303910,
      "text": "有人采访他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00106",
      "start_ms": 304090,
      "end_ms": 306885,
      "text": "问他是怎么发现游河寺分裂的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00107",
      "start_ms": 307410,
      "end_ms": 308430,
      "text": "他当当一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00108",
      "start_ms": 309030,
      "end_ms": 309790,
      "text": "我看见了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00109",
      "start_ms": 309790,
      "end_ms": 310570,
      "text": "就发现了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00110",
      "start_ms": 311110,
      "end_ms": 313390,
      "text": "每个人都可以发现好些东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00111",
      "start_ms": 314070,
      "end_ms": 316130,
      "text": "除非你一天到晚不动脑筋。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00112",
      "start_ms": 316550,
      "end_ms": 320390,
      "text": "记者又提到他为原子弹、氢弹做出的贡献，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00113",
      "start_ms": 321150,
      "end_ms": 322010,
      "text": "他直接说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00114",
      "start_ms": 322870,
      "end_ms": 324050,
      "text": "这不算什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00115",
      "start_ms": 324830,
      "end_ms": 326610,
      "text": "都是些超烂的本子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00116",
      "start_ms": 327650,
      "end_ms": 330810,
      "text": "听说现在的年轻人爱听他的故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00117",
      "start_ms": 331270,
      "end_ms": 332370,
      "text": "老太太头一歪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00118",
      "start_ms": 332690,
      "end_ms": 333790,
      "text": "还有点不乐意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00119",
      "start_ms": 334130,
      "end_ms": 335350,
      "text": "他们来向我学习。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00120",
      "start_ms": 336130,
      "end_ms": 336910,
      "text": "你倒霉了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00121",
      "start_ms": 337050,
      "end_ms": 338900,
      "text": "我们我做事都不符合时代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00122",
      "start_ms": 338960,
      "end_ms": 343760,
      "text": "就是这么一个耿直朴素、不图名不图利的老太太，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00123",
      "start_ms": 344540,
      "end_ms": 347460,
      "text": "把这一辈子都奉献给了这个国家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00124",
      "start_ms": 348360,
      "end_ms": 349620,
      "text": "她出身名门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00125",
      "start_ms": 349960,
      "end_ms": 352180,
      "text": "却选了最难走的那条路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00126",
      "start_ms": 352660,
      "end_ms": 355780,
      "text": "她功高盖世却甘愿隐姓埋名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00127",
      "start_ms": 356620,
      "end_ms": 359540,
      "text": "他把价值连城的祖宅捐给国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00128",
      "start_ms": 359920,
      "end_ms": 362180,
      "text": "自己住二十平米的破房子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00129",
      "start_ms": 363080,
      "end_ms": 366380,
      "text": "何泽会这三个字不该被忘记。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00130",
      "start_ms": 366780,
      "end_ms": 369415,
      "text": "其实像何泽慧这样的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00131",
      "start_ms": 369780,
      "end_ms": 371225,
      "text": "还有很多很多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00132",
      "start_ms": 372050,
      "end_ms": 376170,
      "text": "他们有的在戈壁滩上隐姓埋名几十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00133",
      "start_ms": 376370,
      "end_ms": 379475,
      "text": "有的在实验室里熬到油尽灯枯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00134",
      "start_ms": 380080,
      "end_ms": 382625,
      "text": "有的把毕生积蓄捐给国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00135",
      "start_ms": 383040,
      "end_ms": 385605,
      "text": "自己却连一件新衣服都舍不得买。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00136",
      "start_ms": 386480,
      "end_ms": 389215,
      "text": "他们是真正的国之脊梁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00137",
      "start_ms": 389800,
      "end_ms": 392725,
      "text": "却很少出现在聚光灯下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00138",
      "start_ms": 393580,
      "end_ms": 395900,
      "text": "如果你想知道更多他们的故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00139",
      "start_ms": 396260,
      "end_ms": 396660,
      "text": "推荐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00140",
      "start_ms": 396660,
      "end_ms": 398140,
      "text": "你看看国之脊梁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00141",
      "start_ms": 398160,
      "end_ms": 398735,
      "text": "这本书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00142",
      "start_ms": 399500,
      "end_ms": 405495,
      "text": "书里记录了几十位为新中国立下汗马功劳的科学家和建设者。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00143",
      "start_ms": 406200,
      "end_ms": 409720,
      "text": "钱学森邓稼先、袁隆平、屠呦呦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00144",
      "start_ms": 410040,
      "end_ms": 411880,
      "text": "还有像何泽会这样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00145",
      "start_ms": 411880,
      "end_ms": 413580,
      "text": "功劳簿上没有名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00146",
      "start_ms": 413660,
      "end_ms": 416125,
      "text": "却同样不该被遗忘的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00147",
      "start_ms": 416980,
      "end_ms": 422105,
      "text": "每一个名字背后都是一段拿命拼出来的传奇。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00148",
      "start_ms": 423050,
      "end_ms": 424225,
      "text": "读完你会明白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00149",
      "start_ms": 424940,
      "end_ms": 429060,
      "text": "今天的安稳日子不是天上掉下来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00150",
      "start_ms": 429380,
      "end_ms": 433080,
      "text": "是有人用一辈子替我们扛下来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00151",
      "start_ms": 433920,
      "end_ms": 434160,
      "text": "点。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00152",
      "start_ms": 434220,
      "end_ms": 437500,
      "text": "左下方链接把这本书带回家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00153",
      "start_ms": 438240,
      "end_ms": 440620,
      "text": "自己读也给孩子读，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00154",
      "start_ms": 441420,
      "end_ms": 446000,
      "text": "让我们的下一代知道谁才是真正该追的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00155",
      "start_ms": 446000,
      "end_ms": 451320,
      "text": "星点赞是给何泽会迟来的掌声收发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00156",
      "start_ms": 451740,
      "end_ms": 454380,
      "text": "是怕以后再也找不到这样的故事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00157",
      "start_ms": 454460,
      "end_ms": 460190,
      "text": "收发是让更多人知道谁才是真正的国家脊梁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00158",
      "start_ms": 460790,
      "end_ms": 461450,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d42fb74734d22a7b_s00159",
      "start_ms": 461550,
      "end_ms": 465335,
      "text": "咱们一起把该记住的人一个一个讲完。"
    }
  ],
